        "title": "KMS customer-managed keys per data classification",
        "description": "One AWS KMS customer-managed key and alias for each data classification the caller names (internal, confidential, or restricted), plus IAM policy snippets that let each consumer use only its classification's key through one AWS service.",
        "purpose": "Encryption keys for every regulated resource IRDP creates.",
